{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Pipes 3D</strong> is a fast-paced 3D puzzle game where you must connect pipes on a dynamic grid before water bursts out and chaos erupts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your pipe system from the entry points to  exit points while avoiding obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017910/extras/9b50cc2b6f237dc453652d99e34ca535.avif?t=1757643537\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to replace pipes after a dynamite explosion, and build the longest, twistiest path to boost your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle handcrafted puzzles in <strong>Normal Mode</strong>, where difficulty ramps up steadily to keep your brain on its toes. In the demo, you can play first 10 levels or this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or kick back in <strong>Endless Mode</strong>, a chill, timer-free experience with procedurally generated puzzles \u2014 perfect for relaxed pipe-building fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to outsmart the flood?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017910?t=1757643537","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017910?t=1757643537","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017910/6053ccfd11ebeead1a1e330a882848d5f62cdbd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757643537","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017910/6053ccfd11ebeead1a1e330a882848d5f62cdbd8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757643537","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Pipes 3D</strong> is a fast-paced 3D puzzle game where you must connect pipes on a dynamic grid before water bursts out and chaos erupts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your pipe system from the entry points to  exit points while avoiding obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017910/extras/9b50cc2b6f237dc453652d99e34ca535.avif?t=1757643537\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to replace pipes after a dynamite explosion, and build the longest, twistiest path to boost your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle handcrafted puzzles in <strong>Normal Mode</strong>, where difficulty ramps up steadily to keep your brain on its toes. In the demo, you can play first 10 levels or this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or kick back in <strong>Endless Mode</strong>, a chill, timer-free experience with procedurally generated puzzles \u2014 perfect for relaxed pipe-building fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to outsmart the flood?</p>","developers":["Games du Nord"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2386960","name":"Crazy Pipes 3D"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017910/9da5f4d6c1e6ebb32370b3ce98fb6c086560de82/header.jpg?t=1757643537","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],